<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on European media basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on European media basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 360,000 American-style call warrants, on a basket of 15 European media firms, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    15000 FRF		 PREMIUM	=</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     220 FRF		   GEARING	=</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.JAN.00		 PAYDATE	30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS, LUX (APPLIED)  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  15000 FRF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
